:: MP World Domus PostboxEnvelope [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Domus Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Domus Street">>
<</if>>
宅邸街七号院墙外的绿色旧邮筒底部卡着一封没有贴邮票的牛皮信封。<<mpAmbient>>你放缓脚步环顾四周，见信封火漆边还留着一道旧暗记。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[缓步走回宅邸街口 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="wev-mp-world-domus-postboxenvelope">
<<mpcarryicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "取出牛皮信封 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-domus-postboxenvelope">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_domus_postboxenvelope")>><<money 220>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你借着宅邸街七号院墙的阴影拆开牛皮信封，把夹在信纸里的旧银币与未鉴定古物揣进衣袋。<span class="green">你在邮筒底座下顺利起出了牛皮信封。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	牛皮信封被铁皮底座卡得死死的，你伸手拨弄时指节蹭在锈边上，划出一道红印。<span class="red">指节被邮筒底边刮痛，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[矮身再取出信封 (0:04)|MP World Domus PostboxEnvelope]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回宅邸 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[取出牛皮信封 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "取出牛皮信封">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpsewicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<link "沿石缝抽出 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-domus-postboxenvelope">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_domus_postboxenvelope_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你用指尖压住信封边角缓缓抽出，把整封牛皮信连同夹层里的零钞一并取下。<span class="green">你完好无损地抽出了邮筒底部的牛皮信封。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[走回宅邸 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	院墙拐角忽然传来住户交谈声，你动作一滞，袖口蹭上了一层绿漆浮灰。<span class="red">为免引起住户注意，你先停手退开半步。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[敛息再沿石缝抽出 (0:04)|MP World Domus PostboxEnvelope]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回外围通道 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[沿石缝抽出 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "沿石缝抽出">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Barb CrushedWhistleTin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Barb Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Barb Street">>
<</if>>
倒钩街治安亭后方的电线杆下丢着一只被踩瘪的锡制警哨盒。<<mpAmbient>>你驻足留心四周动静，看清盒盖折缝处刻着一枚细小记号。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回倒钩街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="wev-mp-world-barb-crushedwhistletin">
<<mpcarryicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "取出锡制警哨盒 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-barb-crushedwhistletin">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_barb_crushedwhistletin")>><<money 220>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你借着治安亭背光处的掩护撬开锡制警哨盒，把内藏的旧银币与古物妥善收入囊中。<span class="green">你在电线杆旁顺利起出了锡制警哨盒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[收好器物返回 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	扁塌的锡制警哨盒咬合极紧，你发力抠动时指腹擦过翘起的锡皮，留下一道血痕。<span class="red">指腹被翘起的锡皮刮痛，只能暂且罢手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压手再取出哨盒 (0:04)|MP World Barb CrushedWhistleTin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回倒钩街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[取出锡制警哨盒 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "取出锡制警哨盒">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<crimeicon "safe">><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<link "顺墙根暗槽移出 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-barb-crushedwhistletin">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_barb_crushedwhistletin_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你屏住呼吸拨开变形的暗扣，将锡制警哨盒连同底层的零钞一并收入掌中。<span class="green">你用巧劲取出了完好无损的锡制警哨盒。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[转回倒钩街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	街对面忽然响起巡警靴跟敲击石板的声响，你手腕微偏没能着力。<span class="red">你迅速收回手指，决定等街面安静些再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[沉肩再顺墙移出 (0:04)|MP World Barb CrushedWhistleTin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转回倒钩街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[顺墙根暗槽移出 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "顺墙根暗槽移出">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Danube IronGateSpectacles [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Danube Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Danube Street">>
<</if>>
多瑙河街十二号庄园的雕花铁门下卡着一只丝绒眼镜盒。<<mpAmbient>>你借着石柱阴影扫视左右，注意到盒扣侧面留着前人封存的刻痕。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="wev-mp-world-danube-irongatespectacles">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "挑开眼镜盒扣 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-danube-irongatespectacles">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_danube_irongatespectacles")>><<money 220>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你借着雕花铁门的掩护弹开丝绒眼镜盒，将衬垫下的零散银币与古物一并收好。<span class="green">你在庄园铁门下顺利起出了丝绒眼镜盒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[拍净衣角回街 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	丝绒眼镜盒被铁门底枢夹得很紧，你探手去勾时手背撞在铸铁花纹上，泛起一阵钝痛。<span class="red">手背磕在冰冷的铸铁门栏上，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[俯身再挑开盒扣 (0:04)|MP World Danube IronGateSpectacles]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回多瑙河 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[挑开眼镜盒扣 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "挑开眼镜盒扣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<link "垫帕子取出 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-danube-irongatespectacles">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_danube_irongatespectacles_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你垫着帕子挑开铜弹簧扣，将丝绒眼镜盒连同暗夹层的零钞一并取走。<span class="green">你悄无声息地取下了丝绒眼镜盒。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[转回多瑙河 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	庄园内院飘来一阵穿堂冷风，吹得铁门轻晃，你探手的角度差了半寸。<span class="red">指尖擦过冰冷的铜盒扣，只能暂且作罢。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[凝神再垫帕子取出 (0:04)|MP World Danube IronGateSpectacles]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身步回多瑙河街 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[垫帕子取出 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "垫帕子取出">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Connudatus PosterCompactBox [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Connudatus Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Connudatus Street">>
<</if>>
康努达图斯街露天剧场外墙的海报栏后塞着一只化妆粉盒。<<mpAmbient>>你收敛气息打量周围，发现粉盒金边上压着一道暗纹。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回康努斯街 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="wev-mp-world-connudatus-postercompactbox">
<<cosmeticsicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "摸出化妆粉盒 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-connudatus-postercompactbox">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_connudatus_postercompactbox")>><<money 220>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你借着剧场海报栏的掩护旋开化妆粉盒，把封在粉扑底下的旧银币与古物收进贴身口袋。<span class="green">你在康努达图斯街顺利起出了化妆粉盒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回原处 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	化妆粉盒卡在海报木框的窄缝里，你硬往外抽时指甲磕在铜合页上，生疼难忍。<span class="red">指甲被铜合页夹痛，只得先把手指抽回来。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[蹲身再摸出粉盒 (0:04)|MP World Connudatus PosterCompactBox]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回康努斯街 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[摸出化妆粉盒 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "摸出化妆粉盒">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<crimeicon "safe">><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<link "借盲区解封绳 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-connudatus-postercompactbox">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_connudatus_postercompactbox_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你顺着木框槽位轻轻旋开卡簧，将化妆粉盒连同底垫下的零钞一并取下。<span class="green">你用巧劲取下了完好无损的化妆粉盒。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[退到通风处 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	长街拐角处晃过一道夜巡灯影，你连忙压低身形收住手势。<span class="red">时机稍纵即逝，你只得先退回海报栏暗处。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺势再借盲封绳 (0:04)|MP World Connudatus PosterCompactBox]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转回康努斯街 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[借盲区解封绳 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "借盲区解封绳">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Cliff BenchArmrestRoll [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Cliff Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Cliff Street">>
<</if>>
峭壁街观景长椅的铸铁扶手空腔里塞着一卷防水油纸。<<mpAmbient>>你趁四下无人走近细看，见油纸封口处系着特殊的双套结。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回峭壁 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="wev-mp-world-cliff-bencharmrestroll">
<<mplockpickicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "撬开防水油纸 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-cliff-bencharmrestroll">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_cliff_bencharmrestroll")>><<money 220>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你借着观景长椅靠背的遮挡解开防水油纸，将里头裹着的古旧银币与器物悉数收起。<span class="green">你在峭壁街长椅旁顺利起出了防水油纸卷。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[沿来路返回 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	防水油纸卷在铸铁管腔里胀得极紧，你用力拽动时指骨刮过铁管毛刺，擦破了一点油皮。<span class="red">指骨被铸铁扶手毛刺刮痛，只得先松开手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦手再撬开油纸 (0:04)|MP World Cliff BenchArmrestRoll]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
