<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Oxford Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Oxford Street">>
<</if>>
牛津街书店门廊的雨伞桶底部沉着一只铜制钢笔盒。<<mpAmbient>>你垂眸细看桶底暗处，发现钢笔盒锁扣上刻着细密花体字。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回牛津街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="wev-mp-world-oxford-umbrellastandpenbox">
<<mplockpickicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "撬开钢笔盒 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-oxford-umbrellastandpenbox">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_oxford_umbrellastandpenbox")>><<money 220>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你借着书店门廊的掩护打开铜制钢笔盒，把里头留存的旧银币与古物收进暗袋。<span class="green">你在牛津街书店外顺利起出了铜制钢笔盒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回原处 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜制钢笔盒卡在伞桶铁圈底下，你伸手去捞时手腕蹭在伞尖铜箍上，隐隐作痛。<span class="red">手腕被伞桶铜箍刮痛，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[凑近再撬开钢笔盒 (0:04)|MP World Oxford UmbrellaStandPenBox]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回牛津街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[撬开钢笔盒 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬开钢笔盒">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mptailoricon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<link "衣袖挡视线取下 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-oxford-umbrellastandpenbox">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_oxford_umbrellastandpenbox_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你用衣袖挡住视线拨开伞桶铁圈，将铜制钢笔盒连同衬里下的零钞一并取走。<span class="green">你干净利落地取出了铜制钢笔盒。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回外围通道 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	伞桶底部的陈年积灰呛得你差点咳嗽，手上的动作随之慢了半拍。<span class="red">你掩住口鼻退开半步，暂缓了手头动作。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[矮身再衣袖取下 (0:04)|MP World Oxford UmbrellaStandPenBox]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回前厅 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[衣袖挡视线取下 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "衣袖挡视线取下">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


